            "review_title": "Review at Shiso Rooftop & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Nga N\n1 contribution\n0\nGreat views, good food, excellent service.\nJan 2025 • Family\nwent there with my family on the new year night and such a great spot to watch fireworks. stunning view of the modern side of Saigon. good food also. although it was at peak hours, the service was quick and neat. highly recommend to any couples for a chilling and intimate dinner date! I think it's also suitable for big groups gathering too.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 6, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
