            "review_title": "Review at Shiso Rooftop & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Allison H\n5 contributions\n0\nNice place to celebrate birthday with friends\nJan 2025 • Friends\nCelebrated my birthday at Shiso with 18 friends, and it was an unforgettable experience. I loved the private villa setting. The staff were incredibly helpful and attentive. The best part was definitely the food-unique, flavorful, and well-priced. I especially loved the lettuce cup with Cơm Tấm sauce, a light snack and very healthy.\nWritten January 4, 2025",
